OL,3,GNEWSAFireworks 'exciting but scary' for
OL,4,Aautistic people
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs fireworks begin to light up the
OL,7,Fskies across the West, many families
OL,8,Fare looking forward to Bonfire Night
OL,9,Fcelebrations.
OL,11,FBut for some autistic people, the
OL,12,Fseason brings a different kind of
OL,13,Fanticipation.
OL,15,FDr Angela Kingdon, from Portishead, in
OL,16,Fnorth Somerset, loves getting wrapped
OL,17,Fup warm and spending time with friends
OL,18,Fand family at this time of year.
OL,20,FBut for her, enjoying fireworks takes
OL,21,Fpreparation that many people never have
OL,22,Fto think about.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
